WEBVTT

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:39.510
As of today, Kyoko has resigned
her position at Maison Ikkoku.

00:01:47.690 --> 00:01:48.860
Re--

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:51.830
Resigned?

00:02:01.910 --> 00:02:04.870
It isn't much but...

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:08.970
Please accept this
small parting gift.

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:11.200
Excuse me.

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:20.390
What's going on?

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:24.690
Mrs. Ichinose, have you heard
the manager mention retirement?

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:25.790
Not one word.

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:31.470
'Scuse us.

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:32.720
Comin' through.

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:36.070
We're the movers.
Where's the Manager's Office?

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:39.310
I-It's down the hall, but--

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:40.650
'Scuse us.

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:44.220
--Grab this one.
--Okay.

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:48.620
What are you
guys doin' here?

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:50.180
Moving.
What else?

00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:55.690
"What else?"
Listen--

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:07.190
This is truly retirement.

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:10.010
That's pretty rough.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.560
She could have said
something to me.

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:17.510
I began to think of
her as a younger sister.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:20.910
Wouldn't "granddaughter"
be appropriate?

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:22.810
Younger sister!

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:25.220
Granddaughter?

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:42.770
Thanks for the business.

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:13.120
I thought it was strange.

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:16.510
She suddenly started
fixin' up the place.

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:20.100
They say a bird cleans
its nest before departing.

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:23.720
Maybe that's true, but--

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:29.520
Is this Maison Ikkoku?

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:35.590
You can do it!

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:40.120
He was my husband--

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:43.620
"Save me, my prince!"

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:52.240
I've just now recalled...

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:56.470
...the previous manager
suddenly left as well.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:00.310
Kyoko and that old fart
ain't got nothin' in common!

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:03.020
We treated each
other like family!

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:07.030
How can she
do this to us!?

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:10.150
I'm outta here!
I'm gettin' a drink.

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:21.900
C'mon, kid.
You're comin' with me.

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:34.370
Oh, dear!
Look how late it is!

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:40.560
I'm sorry, Soichiro.
I'll have your dinner in a minute.

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:42.720
I'm home!

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:47.430
I left the door open--

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:51.840
M-Mister Yotsuya.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:56.700
It's all been so sudden. I needed
a moment to compose myself.

00:05:56.810 --> 00:05:57.510
But--

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:07.290
W-What happened?

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:10.580
But I have come
to terms with it.

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:14.180
We have no right
to hold you back.

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:16.550
What are you talking about?

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:19.870
Your mother was here.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:23.560
She announced your resignation.

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:24.270
Wha--!?

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:27.270
Furrther, she
summoned the movers.

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:29.560
What was that!?

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:32.810
Manager!

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:34.180
I'm going to my parents'!

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:42.850
Share this among yourselves.

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:22.950
I expected more
out of the manager.

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:26.600
K-Kyoko!

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:34.190
Greetings.

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:37.690
They're already schnockered.

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:39.900
I see.

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:43.810
Hello, Young Godai?

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:47.770
The manager has
returned to her parents'.

00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:49.610
You saw her!?

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:52.650
She wanted us
to have this.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:05.700
Octopus puffs.

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:11.240
She thinks she can
blow us off with these?

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:19.700
K-Kyoko!

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:21.890
It ain't gonna work!

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:27.560
Lemme have one.

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:32.020
Yotsuya?

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:35.630
Take your
roommates home.

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:39.060
This isn't the
right atmosphere.

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:42.140
Call it a night, Akemi.

00:08:42.550 --> 00:08:44.480
You sure?
Thanks.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:48.510
Homeward bound.

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:52.080
What are you saying?
We're just gettin' started!

00:08:57.100 --> 00:09:02.080
Kyoko!

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:26.280
Ma!
Don't drink so much!

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:28.760
Shut up!
Go to bed!

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:33.660
You're such a wimp!
Cut the tears already!

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:37.130
I can't-- I can't believe
she left like that!

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:45.740
He can't help it.
The woman is an ice cube.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.290
Who'd come here
this late?

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:01.580
The wind, perhaps?

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:07.550
Honestly--

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:11.400
Manager!

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:13.590
What are you
all doing here?

00:10:14.240 --> 00:10:17.230
Look who's talkin'!
You forget somethin'!?

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.470
You went back
to your parents--

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:23.510
Yes, to arrange the
return of my things.

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:26.280
I'm sorry for the
inconvenience.

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:29.520
I never dreamed they'd
go this far while I was out.

00:10:30.420 --> 00:10:33.040
It's all my mother's fault!

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:36.350
I don't get this!

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:39.960
So maybe--
You didn't quit?

00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:41.590
Of course not!

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:43.260
Hurray!

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:47.260
Thank god!

00:10:47.840 --> 00:10:49.000
Hey, Godai?

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:52.100
Don't worry. He's
emotional when he's smashed.

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:55.040
Thank god! Thank god!
Thank god!

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:57.770
Thank god!

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:04.980
This is great!
Let's drink to it.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:07.350
Thank you, my throat
feels so dry.

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:08.850
Why?

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:10.720
I've been yelling a little.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.290
To everyone's health!

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:26.500
I just knew it had
to be a misunderstandin'.

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:38.110
This is great!
This is great!

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:58.500
Thank you, eveyone.
Thank you for caring about me.

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:13.110
M-Manager.

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:44.140
Dear, what is it?

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:46.590
She's just so cute!

00:12:47.110 --> 00:12:49.230
Looking through
that album again?

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:51.440
But, just look!

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:54.670
What do you think?

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:58.380
See? See?

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:08.620
She's so cute.

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:12.760
She was such
a good, obedient girl.

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:15.870
Photos?

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:22.400
Why didn't I
think of that?

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:31.910
Don't you think
they're strange?

00:13:32.190 --> 00:13:35.680
It IS strange!
My parents are abnormal!

00:13:40.060 --> 00:13:43.990
Isn't that going a little far
about your own parents?

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:48.300
I stepped out for a minute,
and they call in the movers!

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:50.160
That's true--

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:52.900
It's weird!
It's even illegal!

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:59.240
Is it just me, or don't you
get along with your folks?

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:01.140
What do YOU think?

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:03.210
I'm just askin'--

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:12.690
You're nice to everyone else.
Why are you so hard on your parents?

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:15.190
They take advantage
when I'm nice.

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:19.450
It's your stubbornness that
makes them treat you that way.

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:23.090
You seem strangely
sympathetic to my parents.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:25.740
I'm a parent myself.

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:29.130
You should be
grateful you got 'em.

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:33.940
Kentaro doesn't
bad-mouth me, does he?

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:34.970
Umm--

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:38.280
I hate this!

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:41.940
She never takes me
anywhere for spring break!

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:44.810
You said the same thing
last summer vacation.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:53.220
Ma just drinks,
day in and day out.

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:56.330
I got a right to
complain once in a while.

00:14:56.470 --> 00:15:00.930
Don't be a crybaby! We got
bigger things to think about.

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:04.030
The manager could
be taken from us!

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:07.010
I hope your ma
handles this right.

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:11.710
She might be the only thing
stopping the manager!

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:20.160
Why don't you stop
your girlfriend yourself!?

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:22.620
What a loser.

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:29.060
I can't do
anything to stop her!

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:35.700
We're nothing more
than "tenant" and "manager."

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:39.840
I'm still just a stranger!

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:46.950
What's up, Ma?

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:48.650
What're you talkin' about?

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:51.380
You haven't taken me
to a movie in forever!

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:53.820
A mom and her kid
can have fun together.

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:57.120
Ya wanna go, don't you?

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:04.870
"Nosy, prying, and prone to
enthusiastic bouts of meddling."

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:09.830
Mrs. Ichinose.
If I could enlist her--

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:19.080
But how will I ask for her help?
Kyoko would be at the apartment.

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.750
My lucky day!

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:29.420
Our meeting
must be fate!

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:30.680
Who're you?

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:33.830
I'm Kyoko Otonashi's mother!

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:37.360
I was just coming
to speak to you.

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:40.100
To me!? Why?

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:42.140
To tell the truth...

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:45.140
...it's so shameful!

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:47.370
You're the only one
I can turn to!

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:51.040
We should get out
of the street then.

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:52.100
Ma!

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:55.470
Then you'll agree
to talk to me?

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:56.440
Why not?

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:58.280
Oh, thank you so much!

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:01.350
Ma! What happened
to the movie!?

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:03.930
This is better than
any old movie!

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:07.630
Look, order
whatever you like!

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:09.860
At this rate, I'm
gonna be a delinquent.

00:17:10.910 --> 00:17:16.400
She took Kentaro to a movie?
That's unusual.

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:20.310
Maybe she got scared hearing the
manager fighting with her folks.

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:22.370
What a rude thing to say!

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:25.730
That don't make
it any less true.

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:38.590
You gonna answer
that, or what?

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:40.690
W-What if it's
my mother again?

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:43.060
You're such a wimp!
I'll get it.

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:45.500
If it's my mother,
I'm not home.

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:46.590
Yeah, yeah.

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:50.400
Hello? Maison Ikkoku.

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:52.070
She's here.

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:54.730
It's a guy.

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:58.730
Hello?

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:00.640
Father!

00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:04.580
Did your mother
drop by?

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:06.690
She's not here. Why?

00:18:06.900 --> 00:18:08.290
N-No reason.

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:12.650
I wanted to talk
to you alone.

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:14.960
And Mother always
changes the subject.

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:17.290
Can I stop by?

00:18:17.810 --> 00:18:19.600
No, I don't mind.

00:18:20.610 --> 00:18:21.440
Okay.

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:25.510
What'd he want?

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:29.600
He's coming here.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:35.580
That old man!

00:18:35.790 --> 00:18:40.250
If he tries to drag Kyoko back,
I'll stop him by force if necessay!

00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:43.790
That's--
That's the least I can do!

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:52.770
M-Manager?
Your father's here.

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:57.040
Father!
That was quick!

00:18:57.810 --> 00:19:00.770
I called from the
pay-phone on the hill.

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:02.910
Let's get out of here.

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:10.710
We're both stubborn, to the point
where she won't listen anymore.

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:15.880
And when I heard of your
reputation from the neighbors--

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:19.190
You were
investigating me?

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:22.430
They say you've been
keeping an eye on Kyoko.

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:26.090
She's a pretty
entertaining gal.

00:19:27.210 --> 00:19:29.170
If only you'd explain!

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:33.630
Please tell Kyoko to
COME HOME!

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:51.160
My husband is prone to illness,
and he is always in the hospital.

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:55.730
Gee, I'm sorry.
I had no idea.

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:57.940
And what's worse
Kyoko won't see him.

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:02.000
But Big Brother Godai said he
saw the manager's father.

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:06.910
He must have checked out of
the hospital to see his daughter!

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:12.080
We must get Kyoko home! I don't
care what method we have to use!

00:20:12.150 --> 00:20:13.340
I see.

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:17.470
I thought that calling
the movers was pretty low.

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:18.940
But this was the reason--

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:25.680
I understand.
I'll help Kyoko see reason.

00:20:26.400 --> 00:20:28.060
Thank you!

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:31.860
So I just
wanted to say...

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:36.470
...it's my fault, too.

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:40.380
So stop being stubborn, and
come home like a good girl.

00:20:41.280 --> 00:20:42.260
Daddy!

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:45.880
It's not that I'm angry when
you opposed my marriage...

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:50.110
...or that you were insensitive
when Soichiro died...

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:53.820
...or that you never once came
with me to visit his gravesite...

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:57.830
...or the other times you let
me down. I'm not mad at that.

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:02.000
K-Kyoko!

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:05.030
I'm not a little girl.

00:21:05.670 --> 00:21:07.900
I have to decide
my own life.

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:13.380
And here I apologized!

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:15.480
Leaving?

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:16.750
Bathroom!

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:27.420
He doesn't
understand anything.

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:31.580
Mind if I come in?

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:35.230
You should go home!

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:39.300
Be a daughter while
you have the chance!

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:40.630
But why are
you suddenly--

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:42.430
Never mind that now.

00:21:43.480 --> 00:21:46.410
You have to consider
your father's feelings!

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:48.910
Parents are parents
no matter what!

00:21:49.550 --> 00:21:51.380
Besides
your father is--

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:53.850
Keep it up.

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:55.230
Who are you?

00:21:55.480 --> 00:21:58.250
Huh? Oh, nice
to meet you.

00:21:58.890 --> 00:22:00.820
I'm Kyoko's father.

00:22:02.260 --> 00:22:03.120
For real?

00:22:04.570 --> 00:22:06.760
You look healthy enough.

00:22:06.840 --> 00:22:07.960
I am, thank you.

00:22:08.370 --> 00:22:12.960
Now that's funny. You don't
look anything like that picture.

00:22:13.040 --> 00:22:13.900
Picture?

00:22:14.710 --> 00:22:15.640
Picture?

00:22:16.140 --> 00:22:20.770
In the picture your mother
showed me, he looked half dead.

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:23.310
That picture was
taken five years ago!

00:22:23.720 --> 00:22:25.050
You've been tricked!

00:22:25.250 --> 00:22:29.940
I told you my mother was
abnormal! Now you see!

00:22:30.690 --> 00:22:32.150
Okay, I'm convinced.

00:22:42.730 --> 00:22:45.690
Why did you sneak
off to see Kyoko!?

00:22:45.770 --> 00:22:47.860
Here I had a
tenant as an ally!

00:22:47.940 --> 00:22:53.310
That pea-brained scam
was doomed from the start!

00:23:07.060 --> 00:23:09.550
Everything turned out
for the best. Drink up!

00:23:09.630 --> 00:23:11.960
Baby, it's cold outside.

00:23:12.730 --> 00:23:15.560
Is this an "end of
construction" party?

00:23:25.680 --> 00:23:26.640
Right.

00:23:27.580 --> 00:23:31.940
It may be
broken-down, but still...

00:23:32.020 --> 00:23:33.480
...it's home.

00:23:50.140 --> 00:23:53.070
Time flies, and before you know it,
it's cherry blossom season!

00:23:53.540 --> 00:23:57.530
Oh, Soichiro! Until I know
what the future holds...

00:23:57.610 --> 00:23:59.570
...I'd like to keep
your last name.

00:24:00.150 --> 00:24:03.270
Next: "Godai in Confusion!
Kozue's First Kiss"

00:24:03.690 --> 00:24:06.810
Honestly, Godai!
What are you thinking!?
